{
  "version": "2.21",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "d2_notes",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "portal-notes",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1240,
      "height": 1160,
      "fill": "$bg-sidebar",
      "cornerRadius": 12,
      "stroke": "$border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0001",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 20,
          "name": "标题",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1192,
          "content": "Issue #118 · D0-2 Portal 响应式设计契约",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0002",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 50,
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1192,
          "content": "portal-responsive.pen · v1.0 · 2026-10-28 · 独立 PR3 / 独立验收 / 独立回滚；评审前稿件",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0003",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 92,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "01 · 文档与断点",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0004",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 120,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "viewport-fit=cover；body 保持文档语义 min-height:100vh，再由后置 @supports 升级 100dvh，不使用主 UI 固定 height。\n≤640px 卡片；641px 起五列网格。640/641 是同一有序列表数据 DOM 的两种网格轨道呈现，不维护 table + cards 两份数据。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0005",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 222,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "02 · Path 与溢出预算",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0006",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 250,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "所有宽度 Path 使用 min-width:0 + overflow-wrap:anywhere 多行完整换行；桌面 Path track 使用 minmax(0,…)，其他 track 不按内容撑宽。\n320/390/640/641/820/1440 验收 200 字符连续路径与 CJK：scrollWidth ≤ clientWidth。触屏无 hover，不用单行 ellipsis + title 作为唯一查看方式。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0007",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 374,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "03 · 触屏、滚动与 CSP",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0008",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 402,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "链接、登录按钮、输入与操作在 coarse 下 ≥44×44 CSS px；hover 仅 hover:hover，补 :focus-visible。\nPortal 是长列表文档：不复制主 UI overflow:hidden / 全局 touchmove preventDefault / touch-action:none；根只抑制链式回弹，浮层 overscroll-behavior:contain。\n静态 style 与 JS .style.display 改 hidden/class；不得添加 unsafe-inline，dashboard 变更后 go generate 并审查 csp_gen.go。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0009",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 570,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "04 · 登录浮层 visible rect",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0010",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 598,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "只改 #token-form 自身 top/height，不改 body/content 高度；有 100vh/100dvh 回退、safe-area、overflow-y:auto。\n空间足够居中、空间不足从顶部可滚；overlay 持 gutter，卡片不重复 safe-area。scale≠1 / 无补偿时清临时几何。\ninitPortalViewportHandling() 先于首次 fetchList()；setTokenFormVisible() 是唯一显隐路径。\nsyncTokenFormViewport() 显示时同步、隐藏时清 top/height；resize 完整判定，scroll 只跟随已补偿浮层。\n输入 ≥16px 防 iOS 聚焦自动放大；普通 Enter 恰好提交一次，IME Enter 不提交；pending finally 解锁，authEpoch 丢弃陈旧 401。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0011",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 786,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "05 · 既有文案与状态",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0012",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 814,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "沿用 Loading instances... / Please login to view instances / Invalid token；空列表保持现有列表结果，不新增 No instances 或网络错误文案。\nAlive/Dead、五位端口、dead 无 Open 均不留下空白操作按钮。登录浮层有 label/error 关联、role=alert 或 aria-live、可访问名称。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0013",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 928,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "06 · 证据边界与评审",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d2_text_0014",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 956,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1180,
          "content": "主 UI 管 #app 的 visibleBottom；Portal 只管理登录浮层 visible rect，二者共享 A0 最终遮挡分类，不共享运行时 JS/CSS。\n妙控候选/浮动栏在密码字段场景目前无法可靠构造：本稿仅记录契约，标为 N/A，不伪造通过场景。\nChromium 几何只证明桌面布局与语义，不能替代 iPadOS Safari 真机；PR3 登录合并还依赖 A0-3。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
