          "content": "生命周期：initPortalViewportHandling() 先于首次 fetchList()；setTokenFormVisible() 唯一显隐；syncTokenFormViewport() 显示同步 / 隐藏清 top,height；resize 完整判定，scroll 仅跟随已补偿浮层。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
